{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/b29kza94","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":28,"width":1480,"height":98},"name":"分類標題","text":"AI 投資像賭博？這週市場在怕什麼？","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":54,"typeface":"可画榜书","color":"#0C1B2F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/7eh0ny1c","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"Slide 2 紙感墨線主圖"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/hwbqtkby","slideIndex":1,"text":"這週，美股的壓力明顯集中在科技股。標普五百指數累計跌約 1.9%，科技股比重較高的那斯達克累計跌約 4.5%，道瓊這週卻仍上漲約 0.7%。市場對不同公司的態度開始分化。前面帶動行情的 AI 股票，這次遇到哪些疑慮？"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/yvh49v","slideIndex":2,"layout":{"id":"ly/07y1cjyt","name":"Blank"},"title":"AI 投資像賭博？這週市場在怕什麼？","textShapes":1,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/lkfmtony","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":0,"top":0,"width":1920,"height":1080},"name":"Freeform 2","geometry":"custom"}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/kj650jmd","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"name":"Freeform 3","geometry":"custom"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7mx4vy54","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":28,"width":1480,"height":98},"name":"分類標題","text":"AI 投資像賭博？這週市場在怕什麼？","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":54,"typeface":"可画榜书","color":"#0C1B2F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/7yhgry5c","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"Slide 3 紙感墨線主圖"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/yvh49v","slideIndex":2,"text":"市場擔心的第一件事，是 AI 花出去的錢到底能賺回多少。10 月 12 日，AI 晶片大廠博通的執行長陳福陽，把許多 AI 投資人比作賭徒。他質疑部分投資人期待很高，卻不理解自己押注的生意。這番話也被市場拿來解釋本週晶片股的賣壓，焦點落在未來獲利能否跟上期待。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/gbahje","slideIndex":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/07y1cjyt","name":"Blank"},"title":"AI 投資像賭博？這週市場在怕什麼？","textShapes":1,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/e9s7u54r","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":0,"top":0,"width":1920,"height":1080},"name":"Freeform 2","geometry":"custom"}
