{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8fup0zmt","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":28,"width":1480,"height":98},"name":"分類標題","text":"AI 投資像賭博？這週市場在怕什麼？","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":54,"typeface":"可画榜书","color":"#0C1B2F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/c76d0nml","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"Slide 4 紙感墨線主圖"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gbahje","slideIndex":3,"text":"另一個可能相關的因素，是通膨又升溫。10 月 14 日公布的美國 9 月消費者物價，年增 3.7%，單月上漲 0.6%。汽油一個月漲了 9.1%，貢獻超過一半的整體月漲幅。這讓市場對利率維持高檔、甚至繼續上升的疑慮更難消退。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/162z9n","slideIndex":4,"layout":{"id":"ly/07y1cjyt","name":"Blank"},"title":"AI 投資像賭博？這週市場在怕什麼？","textShapes":1,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
